        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: తోబుట్టువు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తోబుట్టువు — tōbuṭṭuvu — \"a sibling\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నాకు ఇద్దరు తోబుట్టువులు ఉన్నారు. nāku iddaru tōbuṭṭuvulu unnāru. I have two siblings."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: తోబుట్టువులు, tōbuṭṭuvulu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally born with: brothers and sisters alike."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తోబుట్టువు (tōbuṭṭuvu) is a native compound: tōḍa, \"with\" (DEDR 3563), and puṭṭu, \"to be born\" (DEDR 4264): one born with you."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
